Package: NCAcelerate
Type: Package
Title: Automated Reporting of Non-Compartmental PK Analysis for FIH Studies
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Ruilian (Roxy)", "Zhang", email = "maintainer@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A 'shiny' application and supporting functions that automate the
    reporting of first-in-human (FIH) single ascending dose (SAD) and multiple
    ascending dose (MAD) pharmacokinetic analyses produced by a Phoenix NCA
    workflow. Provides time-concentration plots, summary PK parameter tables
    (geometric mean and CV%, accumulation ratio) and power-model dose
    proportionality assessment with parameter projections.
